    },
    {
      "lemma": "property lemma_3; @(posedge clk) disable iff (rst) (ALLOW_BYPASS != 1 || (((int'(dut.head) + int'(size)) % DEPTH == int'(dut.tail)) && ((int'(fv_env.ref_fifo_head) + int'(size)) % DEPTH == int'(fv_env.ref_fifo_tail)))); endproperty",
      "explanation": "With bypass enabled, each tail remains one occupancy's distance from its head. An empty bypass advances both reference pointers but neither DUT pointer, preserving both ring relationships."
